{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-05-24 06:00:00', 'title': 'IBM TO GRANT $5 MILLION IN-KIND FOR PUBLIC SCHOOLS GLOBALLY TO BETTER PREPARE FOR GROWING RANSOMWARE THREAT', 'text': 'THANKS TO IBM SERVICE CORPS VOLUNTEERS, IBM WILL PROVIDE IN-KIND CYBERSECURITY SUPPORT TO SCHOOLS ACROSS THE UNITED STATES, AS WELL AS BRAZIL, COSTA RICA, IRELAND, AND THE UNITED ARAB EMIRATES. THE GRANTS WILL FOCUS ON THE NEED TO ESTABLISH PROGRAMS THAT HELP ADDRESS CYBERSECURITY RESILIENCY IN SCHOOLS, INCLUDING AGAINST RANSOMWARE.'}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-05-24 05:45:00', 'title': 'IBM ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JUNE 6, 2022 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 24, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION (NYSE: IBM) ALLEGING THAT THE COMPANY VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. CLASS PERIOD: APRIL 4, 2017 TO OCTOBER 20, 2021 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: JUNE 6, 2022 NO OBLIGATION OR COST TO YOU.'}